OL,5,G0100 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FAfter the shooting, Karen is
OL,7,     Frushed to hospital, her life
OL,8,     Fhanging in the balance. David
OL,9,     Frefuses to turn himself in.
OL,10,     FPolitical activist Janet Dominguez
OL,11,     Farrives in Wentworth.
OL,12,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FWhile Karen remains in a critical
OL,14,     Fcondition in hospital, at
OL,15,     FWentworth Ros is assigned to share
OL,16,     Fa room with Kath - but before long
OL,17,     Fone of the cellmates lies
OL,18,     Fcollapsed on the floor...
